<%#
# Sidebar entry

One row of the grouped sidebar (see `_navigation`). The rows follow the
operator app sidebar: h-8, rounded-lg, secondary text when idle, solid brand
pill when current.

The `hover:text-*` classes are deliberate: the Administrate stylesheet colours
every `a:hover`, and a variant class is the only thing that outranks it.

## Local variables:

- `icon`: Tailwind icon class, e.g. `i-lucide-users`. Spelled out in the
  caller so Tailwind sees the class.
- `url`: link target.
- `label`: link text.
- `active`: true for the current section (optional).
- `title`: native tooltip (optional).
%>
<%
  active = local_assigns.fetch(:active, false)
  row_classes = 'flex h-8 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 text-sm'
  state_classes = if active
                    'bg-n-brand-solid font-medium text-n-brand-contrast hover:text-n-brand-contrast'
                  else
                    'text-n-slate-11 hover:bg-n-alpha-2 hover:text-n-slate-11'
                  end
%>
<%= link_to url, class: "#{row_classes} #{state_classes}", title: local_assigns[:title], aria: { current: (active ? 'page' : nil) } do %>
  <span class="<%= icon %> size-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="min-w-0 truncate"><%= label %></span>
<% end %>
